Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "A demon and its pet. I'd love to tame them.
But they may be too much to handle.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "In that case...why not exploit the strength
of the local humans?",
  "1.0.2.0" => "I've come to...ugh...aid your cause. Together
we will make short work of these creatures.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "I must recommend you prioritize the defeat
of The Imprisoned above all other tasks.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Who dares interfere with Lord Ghirahim?!
I must punish you most...deliciously.",
  "1.0.6.0" => "The small one is controlling the big one! If
he takes our base, we lose!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Do you worms call this hole your base?
I will destroy this eyesore with glee!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Guard our base! If anything happens to it,
I'll make you pay ten times over!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "There's a presence inside the sorceress...
Could it be...? No, impossible.",
  "1.0.11.0" => "I am incapable of continuing to fight...
Likelihood of victory is now 1.3%...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "That went rather well! Next, let's recruit
our eccentric friend.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "The Imprisoned has fallen? How? At least I
can turn this around by taking their base.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "There. I cleaned up your mess.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "I underestimated you and your will to win.
I can learn from you...if you'll have me.",
  "1.0.17.0" => "That's it? Your obedience is bought so
cheaply?",
  "1.0.18.0" => "I'm not complaining. And with the demon
tribe tamed, the humans here aren't needed.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Thank you! We'll take all the help we can
get!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "That sword spirit is the only thing keeping
the human army together. We must defeat her.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Great evil has been identified in the enemy
sorceress. Recommend maximum force.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "The newcomers have betrayed us! All
troops, we must protect Skyloft! Attack!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "The newcomers have betrayed us! All
troops, we must protect Skyloft! Attack!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Even these rodents can be trouble if they
gain momentum. Take their keeps!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "They're going for our keeps! That means
their base is unguarded! We can use this!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "We're getting pushed back...",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Not Used",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Skyloft's defensive forces are rapidly
losing combat effectiveness...",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Our base is overrun. We've lost.",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Hgh... Shouldn't have held back... My fight
is over...",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Coward! Stop sneaking around and face
me!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "A lizard in human's clothing could never
comprehend the subtle genius of my work.",
  "1.0.35.0" => "They're putting up a decent fight. We'll
take their keeps, and regain the advantage.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "And, with that, the land in the sky is mine.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "I bow to your strength. Please, let me
conquer the rest of this world for you.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Probability of the hero eventually appearing
is 100%. I will stand by until then.",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Not Used",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Not Used",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Coward! Stop sneaking around and face
me!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "A lizard in human's clothing could never
comprehend the subtle genius of my work.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "The demon is nothing special, but this
giant beast may prove too great a challenge.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "We're not going to fight it head-on, lizard
brain! We'll soften it up with some locals first.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "The demon is nothing special, but this
giant beast may prove too great a challenge.",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Yes, dear--but we're not going to fight it
head-on. We'll convince the humans to help.",
  "1.0.47.0" => "First we need to win the trust of these people...
Go take back one of their keeps as a start.",
  "1.0.48.0" => "What? There's fighting going on
in the north as well?",
  "1.0.49.0" => "It is recommended that you defeat the
Giant Boss as quickly as possible.",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Well done, my sorceress queen!
A marvelous display of skill!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "His compliment rings hollow.
We'd be wise not to trust him.",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Come on! We need to take back this
territory!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "More unsightly enemy troops. Ho hum.
Hurry and take their keeps.",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Is that all you can muster? Your weakness
far outweighs your power.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "You there! Deliver the goods to the front
lines, and rescue our sorceress queen!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Those monsters look like they're up to
something... Everyone, go and beat them!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Delightful! Everything went perfectly!
I hope our mistress is pleased.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "They've already been defeated?
How utterly useless...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "That sword spirit is quite a nuisance...
We need to capture its keep to weaken it!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "I will now move to intercept the
Giant Boss.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Everyone, I command you to gather
around the Giant Boss at once!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "I've been defeated...
How humiliating!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "These annoying enemy soldiers keep
coming... Quickly! Take the fort!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Let's earn the locals' trust and get some of their keeps back
for them, eh?",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Our base is without protection! Someone, help me defend it!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "That went well. Now we just have to recruit the monster boss--
gwee hee hee!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Glad that's taken care of--let's get back to the task at hand.",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Since you asked so nicely, you may join me.",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Humans are a cancerous blight on these fair lands.
Let's excise it, hmmm?",
  "13.0.8.0" => "That spirit is the only thing on their side that even matters.
Kill her and the rest will be easy.",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Surprisingly durable. Perhaps we should concentrate on their
keeps and hurt their morale...",
  "13.0.10.0" => "We've lost our base? Someone's going to suffer very badly
for this...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "I lost? That's so...humiliating.",
  "13.0.12.0" => "This opponent is too strong for me. Can we attack their keeps
first?",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Let's earn the locals' trust and get some of their keeps back
for them, eh?",
}